Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":534,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904633,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284804,"Name":"kdepass2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1442201912,"LastPoster":{"Id":284976,"Name":"CathyJ","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284976.jpg?_r=1443740996","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1904633,"PostDate":1442201912,"PostContent":"Thank god I found this website!! I was researching resort websites and getting so overwhelmed wit...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdepass2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.73.76.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442198069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kdepass2","Id":284804,"Name":"kdepass2","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.73.76.65","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"296e71faa7fd79a495417226913e9790","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank god I found this website!! I was researching resort websites and getting so overwhelmed with so much information. My finace and I plan on getting married next October 2016. We THINK we are settled on Royalton White Sands Jamaica but can any ladies who got married there put my mind at ease by answering a few questions?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) We are hopefully looking for the cost for our guests to be no more than $1500 all-inclusive (flight and resort) for 7 days. Have others found this is plausible for this time? Sometimes it appears to be sitting more around the $1700 mark&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) Just out of interest, how much did your wedding cost? We are looking at roughly 50 guests, just trying to budget&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3) Did you have a private reception, was it good?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4) What kind of menu do they provide?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5) How attentive is the wedding planner? Do they answer in a timely manner?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any recent photos that would help please!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stressed-Out Researching Bride-to-Be,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kathryn&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904633,"PostDate":1442201912,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank god I found this website!! I was researching resort websites and getting so overwhelmed with so much information. My finace and I plan on getting married next October 2016. We THINK we are settled on Royalton White Sands Jamaica but can any ladies who got married there put my mind at ease by answering a few questions?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) We are hopefully looking for the cost for our guests to be no more than $1500 all-inclusive (flight and resort) for 7 days. Have others found this is plausible for this time? Sometimes it appears to be sitting more around the $1700 mark<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2) Just out of interest, how much did your wedding cost? We are looking at roughly 50 guests, just trying to budget<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3) Did you have a private reception, was it good?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4) What kind of menu do they provide?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5) How attentive is the wedding planner? Do they answer in a timely manner?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have any recent photos that would help please!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stressed-Out Researching Bride-to-Be,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kathryn<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdepass2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.73.76.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442198069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kdepass2","Id":284804,"Name":"kdepass2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b596b1429623ebb113249d27c95169f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome!! Jamaica is a beautiful place to get married! There have been a couple of brides at Royalton and some future brides as well. I&#039;ve attached one of the threads that I found. Definitely do a search in the search bar at the top of the page and a couple more will come up along with reviews. If you spend some time reading you&#039;ll probably get your questions answered, or at least a couple of them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76145-royalton-white-sands\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76145-royalton-white-sands\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The other thing is a travel agent. They will be invaluable with taking care of your guests while you plan your wedding! You can speak to them about your wants and don&#039;t wants and your budget and the budget you would like for your guests. They can also help out with possible group perks you might be entitled to so definitely worth talking to one to see if there is anything that you might qualify for. You don&#039;t say what country you&#039;re located in - if you ask the ladies here will definitely provide TA recommendations!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904644,"PostDate":1442207707,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome!! Jamaica is a beautiful place to get married! There have been a couple of brides at Royalton and some future brides as well. I've attached one of the threads that I found. Definitely do a search in the search bar at the top of the page and a couple more will come up along with reviews. If you spend some time reading you'll probably get your questions answered, or at least a couple of them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76145-royalton-white-sands\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...on-white-sands\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The other thing is a travel agent. They will be invaluable with taking care of your guests while you plan your wedding! You can speak to them about your wants and don't wants and your budget and the budget you would like for your guests. They can also help out with possible group perks you might be entitled to so definitely worth talking to one to see if there is anything that you might qualify for. You don't say what country you're located in - if you ask the ladies here will definitely provide TA recommendations!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7220c1380d75e6b40d3343644fbfe272","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there, we are getting married at the Royalton White Sands on May 4, 2016. Our guests are paying $1683 including taxes for 7 days flying from Toronto, I am not sure where you are flying out from. I have all the pricing brochures and I can email them to you if you would like. We are having a private reception on the beach. We have 50 guests attending.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The great thing about the wedding planner is she is based in Toronto. There is a wedding planner in Jamaica, but you will only deal with them when you arrive. I have been speaking to Ashley from Toronto and she has been great at answering all my questions.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904658,"PostDate":1442243434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there, we are getting married at the Royalton White Sands on May 4, 2016. Our guests are paying $1683 including taxes for 7 days flying from Toronto, I am not sure where you are flying out from. I have all the pricing brochures and I can email them to you if you would like. We are having a private reception on the beach. We have 50 guests attending.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The great thing about the wedding planner is she is based in Toronto. There is a wedding planner in Jamaica, but you will only deal with them when you arrive. I have been speaking to Ashley from Toronto and she has been great at answering all my questions.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c53b35fe6b056412922b367766482634","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards, Kathryn and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! yes, you&#039;re certainly right about finding lots of great info, advice, support and resources here to help with your planning decisions ~ well done on joining up :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11060457_10153591362124487_9123701615326726440_o.jpg\" alt=\"11060457_10153591362124487_9123701615326\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904660,"PostDate":1442244018,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards, Kathryn and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! yes, you're certainly right about finding lots of great info, advice, support and resources here to help with your planning decisions ~ well done on joining up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11060457_10153591362124487_9123701615326726440_o.jpg\" alt=\"11060457_10153591362124487_9123701615326\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.164.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0f0825ad1a0b0ef9fc8cfa14af3ea4c","RawContent":"This is one of the resorts I am looking into also for next year! I think I&#039;m between this and iberostar, I want a private reception!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1904689,"PostDate":1442260235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is one of the resorts I am looking into also for next year! I think I'm between this and iberostar, I want a private reception!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"palmisano88@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.194.164.40","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442260135,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284811.jpg?_r=1443744645","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"palmi4488","Id":284811,"Name":"palmi4488","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.145","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f133047dc7cb4a78f843dd7773137c1f","RawContent":"I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suite this June with a private reception. Happy to answer any questions!\n[quote name=\"palmi4488\" post=\"1904689\" timestamp=\"1442260235\"]\nThis is one of the resorts I am looking into also for next year! I think I&#039;m between this and iberostar, I want a private reception!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1905002,"PostDate":1442600905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suite this June with a private reception. Happy to answer any questions!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>palmi4488, on 14 September 2015 - 11:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is one of the resorts I am looking into also for next year! I think I'm between this and iberostar, I want a private reception!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.209.238.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bc8ab768a8d0cc37ea67d4580c39d88","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1905002\" timestamp=\"1442600905\"]\nI got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suite this June with a private reception. Happy to answer any questions![\/quote]\nDid you have at least 40 people? I have read that if you have under 40 that it can&#039;t be private. I even read a bride here that said she paid the extra money to make it private, all the way up till she got there, they then told her that there were too many reservations for the night made and she wasn&#039;t going to be able to make the restaurant private.","Attachments":[],"Id":1905003,"PostDate":1442602301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 18 September 2015 - 10:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suite this June with a private reception. Happy to answer any questions!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nDid you have at least 40 people? I have read that if you have under 40 that it can't be private. I even read a bride here that said she paid the extra money to make it private, all the way up till she got there, they then told her that there were too many reservations for the night made and she wasn't going to be able to make the restaurant private.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"palmisano88@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.194.164.40","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442260135,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284811.jpg?_r=1443744645","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"palmi4488","Id":284811,"Name":"palmi4488","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.179.187.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f39918365a05a0351038ed1e4066c17","RawContent":"Hi - I think that is true actually, that you need 40 people to have one of the restaurants for a private reception. We had 67 and our reception was at Calabash. It was $800 extra to have it private. I am surprised by the other brides experience - I&#039;m part of a Facebook group just for brides at the Iberostars in Jamaica and I&#039;ve never heard anything like that! So I really don&#039;t think that is anything to worry about. \n\nLots of brides do a private tented reception on the beach, or do the semi-private dinner and then a private bonfire on the beach for dancing. Or the semi-private dinner with a private reception in the Music Lounge or in the disco. Our rehearsal dinner was semi-private at the steakhouse and we could not tell at all that there were other people in the restaurant. There were in a separate section and we didn&#039;t even see them until we were walking out. \n\nWe got married in June so I was worried about it being really hot, which is why I wanted it inside!\n[quote name=\"palmi4488\" post=\"1905003\" timestamp=\"1442602301\"]\nDid you have at least 40 people? I have read that if you have under 40 that it can&#039;t be private. I even read a bride here that said she paid the extra money to make it private, all the way up till she got there, they then told her that there were too many reservations for the night made and she wasn&#039;t going to be able to make the restaurant private.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1905047,"PostDate":1442681920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi - I think that is true actually, that you need 40 people to have one of the restaurants for a private reception. We had 67 and our reception was at Calabash. It was $800 extra to have it private. I am surprised by the other brides experience - I'm part of a Facebook group just for brides at the Iberostars in Jamaica and I've never heard anything like that! So I really don't think that is anything to worry about.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lots of brides do a private tented reception on the beach, or do the semi-private dinner and then a private bonfire on the beach for dancing. Or the semi-private dinner with a private reception in the Music Lounge or in the disco. Our rehearsal dinner was semi-private at the steakhouse and we could not tell at all that there were other people in the restaurant. There were in a separate section and we didn't even see them until we were walking out.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We got married in June so I was worried about it being really hot, which is why I wanted it inside!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>palmi4488, on 18 September 2015 - 10:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Did you have at least 40 people? I have read that if you have under 40 that it can't be private. I even read a bride here that said she paid the extra money to make it private, all the way up till she got there, they then told her that there were too many reservations for the night made and she wasn't going to be able to make the restaurant private.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.132.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7c92232cf989209e2d3ac5a7a58e475","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1905047\" timestamp=\"1442681920\"]\nHi - I think that is true actually, that you need 40 people to have one of the restaurants for a private reception. We had 67 and our reception was at Calabash. It was $800 extra to have it private. I am surprised by the other brides experience - I&#039;m part of a Facebook group just for brides at the Iberostars in Jamaica and I&#039;ve never heard anything like that! So I really don&#039;t think that is anything to worry about. \n \nLots of brides do a private tented reception on the beach, or do the semi-private dinner and then a private bonfire on the beach for dancing. Or the semi-private dinner with a private reception in the Music Lounge or in the disco. Our rehearsal dinner was semi-private at the steakhouse and we could not tell at all that there were other people in the restaurant. There were in a separate section and we didn&#039;t even see them until we were walking out. \n \nWe got married in June so I was worried about it being really hot, which is why I wanted it inside![\/quote]I decided to go with the Royalton white sands! My fianc\u00e9 doesn&#039;t want a beach reception and I&#039;m firm on the private reception so unfortunately I didn&#039;t want to risk it at the iberostar. I think both places are lovely and we are lucky to get married at either one!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905049,"PostDate":1442682436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 19 September 2015 - 08:58 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi - I think that is true actually, that you need 40 people to have one of the restaurants for a private reception. We had 67 and our reception was at Calabash. It was $800 extra to have it private. I am surprised by the other brides experience - I'm part of a Facebook group just for brides at the Iberostars in Jamaica and I've never heard anything like that! So I really don't think that is anything to worry about.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nLots of brides do a private tented reception on the beach, or do the semi-private dinner and then a private bonfire on the beach for dancing. Or the semi-private dinner with a private reception in the Music Lounge or in the disco. Our rehearsal dinner was semi-private at the steakhouse and we could not tell at all that there were other people in the restaurant. There were in a separate section and we didn't even see them until we were walking out.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe got married in June so I was worried about it being really hot, which is why I wanted it inside!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI decided to go with the Royalton white sands! My fianc\u00e9 doesn't want a beach reception and I'm firm on the private reception so unfortunately I didn't want to risk it at the iberostar. I think both places are lovely and we are lucky to get married at either one! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"palmisano88@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.194.164.40","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442260135,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284811.jpg?_r=1443744645","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"palmi4488","Id":284811,"Name":"palmi4488","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.179.187.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1bcadd9cd7e17905f3ad910d9e80792","RawContent":"Congrats! Picking the resort is the hardest part! I&#039;m sure it&#039;ll be fab :)\n[quote name=\"palmi4488\" post=\"1905049\" timestamp=\"1442682436\"]\nI decided to go with the Royalton white sands! My fianc\u00e9 doesn&#039;t want a beach reception and I&#039;m firm on the private reception so unfortunately I didn&#039;t want to risk it at the iberostar. I think both places are lovely and we are lucky to get married at either one![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1905057,"PostDate":1442689597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! Picking the resort is the hardest part! I'm sure it'll be fab <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>palmi4488, on 19 September 2015 - 09:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I decided to go with the Royalton white sands! My fianc\u00e9 doesn't want a beach reception and I'm firm on the private reception so unfortunately I didn't want to risk it at the iberostar. I think both places are lovely and we are lucky to get married at either one!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79588","Title":"Tentative Royalton White Sands Jamaica Wedding","LastPostDate":1443747784},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
