nks & URL). \u00a0TA Wendy, TA Patty, TA Krist...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC B