#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GET A $1500 RESORT CREDIT AT MOON PALACE GOLF &amp;amp; SPA RESORT! &amp;nbsp;THEY&#039;RE ALSO LETTING THE KIDS STAY FREE. WHAT COULD BE BETTER?!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moon Palace Golf &amp;amp; Spa Resort&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;All-inclusive&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Children 12 years old and under stay and eat free (maximum 2 children)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;$1500 resort credit (restrictions apply)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Superior Deluxe Resort View Room&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;5 nights from $589 per person&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Dates&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Book from 03\/26\/2014 through 08\/28\/2014&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Travel from 06\/01\/2014 through 08\/31\/2014&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Blackout Dates: May Apply&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Minimum Night Stay: 5 Nights&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOOK NOW WITH WRIGHT TRAVEL AGENCY&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n&lt;strong&gt;Call:&amp;nbsp;888-471-1950   &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"29\" src=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/10\/contact-us1.jpg\" width=\"102\" alt=\"contact-us1.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moon Palace Golf &amp;amp; Spa Resort&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;\n&lt;ul  class=\"\"&gt;&lt;li&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Well-situated&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Surrounded by lush tropical foliage this all-inclusive beachfront resort is just south of Cancun and minutes from the airport.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Double spa tubs&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;2,457 guestrooms at the Moon Palace Golf &amp;amp; Spa Resort are designed for romance and relaxation with double spa tubs and balconies in all room categories. Golf villas overlook the signature course.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Water activities and golf&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Enjoy 7 pools, the new Florider and Dolphinarium, an on-site Jack Nicklaus signature golf course, full-service spa, Kids&#039; Club, tennis, and 14 restaurants.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Expect:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Functioning as a self-contained village, the immense resort attracts couples and families seeking activity-filled days and nights, golfers eager to play a three 9-hole golf courses, and romance-minded couples desiring spa pampering and secluded sunbathing on the beach.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;\n&lt;strong&gt;Amenity Highlights:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Facing 1 km (0.75 mi) of beach, two sections of the resort include an immense lagoon-style swimming pool measuring more than 200 meters (219 yards) wide, while a third section features 5 outdoor pools with swim up bars. Use of kayaks, Hobie Cat sailboats, and other non motorized water sports are all part of the All-Inclusive Plan, as is a championship-grade miniature golf course. Golfers pay extra to play three 9-hole courses (each par 36, with a total of 9,874 meters (10,798 yards). Also available for extra charges are treatments in a 30-room health spa.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Palace Resorts&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;With seven oceanfront resorts overlooking the sparkling turquoise waters of the Caribbean Sea, Palace Resorts sets the highest standards for all-inclusive vacations in Canc\u00fan, Cozumel, Isla Mujeres and Riviera Maya, Mexico. Offering luxurious and spacious accommodations accentuated by signature in-room double whirlpool tubs, nightly entertainment, the Caribbean\u2019s most extravagant spas and premier Jack Nicklaus signature golf courses, Palace Resorts offers a truly exceptional experience for travelers. The unparalleled level of service and comfort found at each property makes Palace Resorts a leading provider of world-class resort vacations.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Terms and Conditions&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;Pricing is based on an occupancy of 2 adults and 2 children under 12 years old. $1500 in Vacation Dollars that can be used towards: Wedding Collections, Tours, Golf, Spa\/Beauty Salon, Upgraded wine selection, Romantic Dinner, Room Upgrades, Photography packages, Dolphins where applicable. Offers valid on new bookings only. Prices shown are per-person, land only based upon double occupancy, except if expressly noted otherwise. Offers are subject to availability at time of booking and may be changed or discontinued at any time without notice. Blackout dates, minimum night stays, minimum stay requirements on air, seasonal surcharges, resort fees (if any), and other restrictions may also apply. Individual offers may require purchase of Travel Smart Plan or travel waiver. Offers are not valid for Group Travel. Some booking and travel dates may vary. Other promotions and departure dates available which may result in a different rate and\/or hotel inclusion. Customer is responsible for hotel taxes and fees on the free night offers, where applicable.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, &#039;Bitstream Charter&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/05\/BDWmoonpalace.jpg\" alt=\"BDWmoonpalace.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849826,"PostDate":1399881026,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>GET A $1500 RESORT CREDIT AT MOON PALACE GOLF & SPA RESORT! \u00a0THEY'RE ALSO LETTING THE KIDS STAY FREE. WHAT COULD BE BETTER?!\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>Moon Palace Golf & Spa Resort<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>All-inclusive<\/li>\n<li>Children 12 years old and under stay and eat free (maximum 2 children)<\/li>\n<li>$1500 resort credit (restrictions apply)<\/li>\n<li>Superior Deluxe Resort View Room<\/li>\n<li>5 nights from $589 per person<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>Important Dates<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul><li>Book from 03\/26\/2014 through 08\/28\/2014<\/li>\n<li>Travel from 06\/01\/2014 through 08\/31\/2014<\/li>\n<li>Blackout Dates: May Apply<\/li>\n<li>Minimum Night Stay: 5 Nights<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>BOOK NOW WITH WRIGHT TRAVEL AGENCY\u00a0<\/strong><br><strong>Call:\u00a0888-471-1950 \u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"29\" src=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/10\/contact-us1.jpg\" width=\"102\" alt=\"contact-us1.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>About Moon Palace Golf & Spa Resort\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\n<ul  class=\"\"><li>\n<div  style=\"font-weight:bold\">Well-situated<\/div>\n<div>Surrounded by lush tropical foliage this all-inclusive beachfront resort is just south of Cancun and minutes from the airport.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div  style=\"font-weight:bold\">Double spa tubs<\/div>\n<div>2,457 guestrooms at the Moon Palace Golf & Spa Resort are designed for romance and relaxation with double spa tubs and balconies in all room categories. Golf villas overlook the signature course.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div  style=\"font-weight:bold\">Water activities and golf<\/div>\n<div>Enjoy 7 pools, the new Florider and Dolphinarium, an on-site Jack Nicklaus signature golf course, full-service spa, Kids' Club, tennis, and 14 restaurants.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul><\/div>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>What to Expect:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>Functioning as a self-contained village, the immense resort attracts couples and families seeking activity-filled days and nights, golfers eager to play a three 9-hole golf courses, and romance-minded couples desiring spa pampering and secluded sunbathing on the beach.<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<br><strong>Amenity Highlights:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>Facing 1 km (0.75 mi) of beach, two sections of the resort include an immense lagoon-style swimming pool measuring more than 200 meters (219 yards) wide, while a third section features 5 outdoor pools with swim up bars. Use of kayaks, Hobie Cat sailboats, and other non motorized water sports are all part of the All-Inclusive Plan, as is a championship-grade miniature golf course. Golfers pay extra to play three 9-hole courses (each par 36, with a total of 9,874 meters (10,798 yards). Also available for extra charges are treatments in a 30-room health spa.<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>About Palace Resorts<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">With seven oceanfront resorts overlooking the sparkling turquoise waters of the Caribbean Sea, Palace Resorts sets the highest standards for all-inclusive vacations in Canc\u00fan, Cozumel, Isla Mujeres and Riviera Maya, Mexico. Offering luxurious and spacious accommodations accentuated by signature in-room double whirlpool tubs, nightly entertainment, the Caribbean\u2019s most extravagant spas and premier Jack Nicklaus signature golf courses, Palace Resorts offers a truly exceptional experience for travelers. The unparalleled level of service and comfort found at each property makes Palace Resorts a leading provider of world-class resort vacations.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><strong>Terms and Conditions<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">Pricing is based on an occupancy of 2 adults and 2 children under 12 years old. $1500 in Vacation Dollars that can be used towards: Wedding Collections, Tours, Golf, Spa\/Beauty Salon, Upgraded wine selection, Romantic Dinner, Room Upgrades, Photography packages, Dolphins where applicable. Offers valid on new bookings only. Prices shown are per-person, land only based upon double occupancy, except if expressly noted otherwise. Offers are subject to availability at time of booking and may be changed or discontinued at any time without notice. Blackout dates, minimum night stays, minimum stay requirements on air, seasonal surcharges, resort fees (if any), and other restrictions may also apply. Individual offers may require purchase of Travel Smart Plan or travel waiver. Offers are not valid for Group Travel. Some booking and travel dates may vary. Other promotions and departure dates available which may result in a different rate and\/or hotel inclusion. Customer is responsible for hotel taxes and fees on the free night offers, where applicable.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', 'Bitstream Charter', Times, serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/05\/BDWmoonpalace.jpg\" alt=\"BDWmoonpalace.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bobbified@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.189.75.149","GroupId":56,"GroupName":"Community Manager","JoinDate":1352931015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262375.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":279,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"1fungrl","Id":262375,"Name":"1fungrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77040,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d098464442e9f46f53f9037358216458","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This resort is great!&amp;nbsp; Was there July 2013 for a wedding, absolutely beautiful.&amp;nbsp; Moon Palace will always have a special memory for me as my fiance proposed while we were there.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849961,"PostDate":1399922388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This resort is great!\u00a0 Was there July 2013 for a wedding, absolutely beautiful.\u00a0 Moon Palace will always have a special memory for me as my fiance proposed while we were there.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77040,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4ebafbbacdc2bcbd3fe40f8e6b8ab61","RawContent":"that is so romantic!!\n[quote name=\"FutureMrsGlover\" post=\"1849961\" timestamp=\"1399922388\"]\nThis resort is great!  Was there July 2013 for a wedding, absolutely beautiful.  Moon Palace will always have a special memory for me as my fiance proposed while we were there.  :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1850100,"PostDate":1400000774,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>that is so romantic!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsGlover, on 12 May 2014 - 11:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This resort is great!\u00a0 Was there July 2013 for a wedding, absolutely beautiful.\u00a0 Moon Palace will always have a special memory for me as my fiance proposed while we were there.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.188.148.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77040,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc4b0a8c856acb5417065da2abe4e936","RawContent":"[emoji51]","Attachments":[],"Id":1871724,"PostDate":1410673807,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                [emoji51] \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382748874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77040","Title":"$1500 Resort Credit At Moon Palace Golf And Spa Resort","LastPostDate":1410673807},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
