t sunrise in Kauai after nearly 9 years together! Happy in an understatement!! We live in the UK and are planning to go back to Hawaii to get married in 2017. \n\n\nThere will only be around 11 of us attending, and I was wondering if there were any tips anyone could suggest? \n\n\nI had an idea to rent a beach house so we could all stay together and cater ourselves?! \n\n\nThanks\n\nAlicia :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1905815,"PostDate":1443754226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! <br><br>\nMy fianc\u00e9 recently proposed to me on a beach at sunrise in Kauai after nearly 9 years together! Happy in an understatement!! We live in the UK and are planning to go back to Hawaii to get married in 2017. <br><br>\nThere will only be around 11 of us attending, and I was wondering if there were any tips anyone could suggest? <br><br>\nI had an idea to rent a beach house so we could all stay together and cater ourselves?! <br><br>\nThanks<br>\nAlicia :-) \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aliciahughes892@aol.com","IpAddress":"176.252.17.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443753604,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284994.jpg?_r=1443768003","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Alicia2007Andrew","Id":284994,"Name":"Alicia2007Andrew","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79636","Title":"New Bride To Be","LastPostDate":1443754226},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-