{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.31.82.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a53ea9a8999aae8252d63710935b221","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RivieraBride15\"] Love your Story about how you met, and got engaged! And that Dress! It is so pretty on you! I cant wait to see it altered on Sunday! I can&#039;t believe you lost 30lbs! That is such hard work!!! Way to go! I&#039;ve been trying for months..but you must have the determination! Your cake topper is awesome! So funny and cute!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You only have 40 something days left! you must be totally excited now! Cant wait to read \/see more :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904517,"PostDate":1441962930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279902\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279902-rivierabride15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RivieraBride15<\/span><\/a> Love your Story about how you met, and got engaged! And that Dress! It is so pretty on you! I cant wait to see it altered on Sunday! I can't believe you lost 30lbs! That is such hard work!!! Way to go! I've been trying for months..but you must have the determination! Your cake topper is awesome! So funny and cute!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You only have 40 something days left! you must be totally excited now! Cant wait to read \/see more <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e237e7c0ee40f7e1354428d79ddaa908","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Meandhim\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!! I can&#039;t wait to see it with all the alterations being done! Losing the weight wasn&#039;t too, too bad.&amp;nbsp; I did the Stillmans diet and on that the weight pretty much falls off up to a point.&amp;nbsp; Once I hit a lull, thats when I really started to kick butt with my walking and watching what I am eating.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904519,"PostDate":1441963852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!! I can't wait to see it with all the alterations being done! Losing the weight wasn't too, too bad.\u00a0 I did the Stillmans diet and on that the weight pretty much falls off up to a point.\u00a0 Once I hit a lull, thats when I really started to kick butt with my walking and watching what I am eating.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411109203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43535a6c1fd1057580ec4a3b0872abd7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RivieraBride15\"] Contracts on your upcoming wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so sorry about the loss of your brother, that must be so hard. &amp;nbsp;Both him and your fianc\u00e9&#039;s brother will for sure be there in spirit, hopefully having a toast up in the sky for you two!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You look amazing in your dress! &amp;nbsp;Congrats on the weight loss that&#039;s incredible - we have a support and accountability group here on the forum that a bunch of us are in, all trying to look and feel amazing on our big days, feel free to join us - would be great to have someone who&#039;s accomplished that goal in the mix!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to see your dress after the fitting and the rest of your planning :) &amp;nbsp;xo&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904520,"PostDate":1441964209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279902\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279902-rivierabride15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RivieraBride15<\/span><\/a> Contracts on your upcoming wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so sorry about the loss of your brother, that must be so hard. \u00a0Both him and your fianc\u00e9's brother will for sure be there in spirit, hopefully having a toast up in the sky for you two!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You look amazing in your dress! \u00a0Congrats on the weight loss that's incredible - we have a support and accountability group here on the forum that a bunch of us are in, all trying to look and feel amazing on our big days, feel free to join us - would be great to have someone who's accomplished that goal in the mix!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to see your dress after the fitting and the rest of your planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0xo\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1442083173","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1441967388,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b145202326ef0783020a3acda938e6bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"deecol\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will check out that group!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And thank you for your kind words!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904524,"PostDate":1441967358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281751\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281751-deecol\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">deecol<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will check out that group!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And thank you for your kind words!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411109203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.59.172.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb287bfaf786af9ccd154045faef6602","RawContent":"Here is the frame I put together to honor our two brothers.  \n\n\n\n\n\nI went with the black frame to match the frame that we are using for our sand ceremony.  So, once the ceremony is complete...behind the photo you will see layered white and pink sand.  Minus the blue tape, that&#039;s the plug that I know I will lose if I remove it lol. \n\n\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1904540,"PostDate":1441979039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is the frame I put together to honor our two brothers.  <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904540]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-65648400-1441993330.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  184.48KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-65648400-1441993330.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nI went with the black frame to match the frame that we are using for our sand ceremony.  So, once the ceremony is complete...behind the photo you will see layered white and pink sand.  Minus the blue tape, that's the plug that I know I will lose if I remove it lol. <br><br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1904540]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-77885200-1441993430.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  177.57KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-279902-0-77885200-1441993430.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411109203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.59.172.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15b22ef6482e2bc76a6d775bc30be8b7","RawContent":"Well, no dress pictures from today&#039;s fitting.  I put it on and instantly knew something wasn&#039;t right.  It still needs to be taken in on the one side and they couldn&#039;t figure out what the problem is but the material underneath was all bunched up.  I go back on the 7th for my next fitting and hopefully they will have everything figured out by then.  Getting awfully close to the big day.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904617,"PostDate":1442177443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well, no dress pictures from today's fitting.  I put it on and instantly knew something wasn't right.  It still needs to be taken in on the one side and they couldn't figure out what the problem is but the material underneath was all bunched up.  I go back on the 7th for my next fitting and hopefully they will have everything figured out by then.  Getting awfully close to the big day. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411109203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"928777649b9f40461b86284999e661a0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So, my wedding planner replied to a list of questions that I had sent her.&amp;nbsp; One of them was about making my hair appointment, she in turn asked if I wanted to swtich my ceremony time as 2pm can be hot.&amp;nbsp; I asked for her suggestion and she said 4:30 as 5 is too late because the sun starts to set.&amp;nbsp; Here is my concern, if our ceremony is at 4:30 and then we have an hour long cocktail hour (which we want to attend) and then do photos before dinner.&amp;nbsp; We will never fit everything in before the sun sets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am trying SO hard not to get frustrated but it feel like I am pulling teeth.&amp;nbsp; They want their money within the next couple of weeks, but I don&#039;t know what I owe as they haven&#039;t given me the checklist to start picking.&amp;nbsp; In my last email I did ask when we would start working on those details.&amp;nbsp; Mind you, we are a smaller group...7 of us and it seems like everything she says 10 people and up.&amp;nbsp; Really hope I am reading into everthing too much, because between this and my fitting yesterday...I feel like my head is going to explode!&amp;nbsp; -_-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rant over lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904663,"PostDate":1442233615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So, my wedding planner replied to a list of questions that I had sent her.\u00a0 One of them was about making my hair appointment, she in turn asked if I wanted to swtich my ceremony time as 2pm can be hot.\u00a0 I asked for her suggestion and she said 4:30 as 5 is too late because the sun starts to set.\u00a0 Here is my concern, if our ceremony is at 4:30 and then we have an hour long cocktail hour (which we want to attend) and then do photos before dinner.\u00a0 We will never fit everything in before the sun sets.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am trying SO hard not to get frustrated but it feel like I am pulling teeth.\u00a0 They want their money within the next couple of weeks, but I don't know what I owe as they haven't given me the checklist to start picking.\u00a0 In my last email I did ask when we would start working on those details.\u00a0 Mind you, we are a smaller group...7 of us and it seems like everything she says 10 people and up.\u00a0 Really hope I am reading into everthing too much, because between this and my fitting yesterday...I feel like my head is going to explode!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sleep.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='-_-' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Rant over lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411109203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1442237225,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1eeb959202b9e086ab0d0373c14db626","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey, I just did a quick search of the sunset time on October 27th and it says 6:15pm....which means no later than 6:30pm it will be dark outside, if not by 6:15pm. They just lose the light there.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So if you have your ceremony at 4:30pm-5:00pm, then you spend the entire cocktail hour with your guests, I don&#039;t feel you will have enough sun for pictures.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Generally the rule of thumb is to have your ceremony 2 hours before sunset, but that is for the ceremony and pictures, I don&#039;t believe they take into account you are having a cocktail with your guests.   &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since you have a small party, I think you have some wiggle room as group pics won&#039;t take you very long, but if you want to have an hour cocktail party with your guests, then an hour or so to have photos with your husband, I would probably suggest starting at around 3:30pm ish.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3:30-4:00pm ceremony&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4:00-5:00pm cocktail hour&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5:00-6:00pm photos for you and your spouse&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is what we did - we lost light around 5:30pm in January...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3:00-3:30pm ceremony\/toast&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3:30-4:00pm group\/family photos&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4:00-5:00pm my guests had cocktails\/mariachi and we did our bride\/groom shots&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5:00pm reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(I had originally booked for 3:30pm but I was nervous they wouldn&#039;t be on time and we wouldn&#039;t have enough sunlight, so I bumped it up just to make myself less stressed -- of course they were on time)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps some!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904669,"PostDate":1442237136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey, I just did a quick search of the sunset time on October 27th and it says 6:15pm....which means no later than 6:30pm it will be dark outside, if not by 6:15pm. They just lose the light there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So if you have your ceremony at 4:30pm-5:00pm, then you spend the entire cocktail hour with your guests, I don't feel you will have enough sun for pictures.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Generally the rule of thumb is to have your ceremony 2 hours before sunset, but that is for the ceremony and pictures, I don't believe they take into account you are having a cocktail with your guests. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since you have a small party, I think you have some wiggle room as group pics won't take you very long, but if you want to have an hour cocktail party with your guests, then an hour or so to have photos with your husband, I would probably suggest starting at around 3:30pm ish.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3:30-4:00pm ceremony<\/p>\n<p>4:00-5:00pm cocktail hour\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5:00-6:00pm photos for you and your spouse<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is what we did - we lost light around 5:30pm in January...<\/p>\n<p>3:00-3:30pm ceremony\/toast<\/p>\n<p>3:30-4:00pm group\/family photos<\/p>\n<p>4:00-5:00pm my guests had cocktails\/mariachi and we did our bride\/groom shots<\/p>\n<p>5:00pm reception<\/p>\n<p>(I had originally booked for 3:30pm but I was nervous they wouldn't be on time and we wouldn't have enough sunlight, so I bumped it up just to make myself less stressed -- of course they were on time)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps some!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05381b2aa99e0cac8d436b425f5770ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you for this....I wonder why they are pushing the 5pm time for sunset then?&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s what had me in such a panic.&amp;nbsp;I see a lot of issues with their way of planning, and I am such a planner it&#039;s getting hard to stay relaxed during all of this lol.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904671,"PostDate":1442237504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for this....I wonder why they are pushing the 5pm time for sunset then?\u00a0 That's what had me in such a panic.\u00a0I see a lot of issues with their way of planning, and I am such a planner it's getting hard to stay relaxed during all of this lol.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/<\/a>","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411109203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79575,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f490dd690af3788f9ed851a8d590d73a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RivieraBride15\" post=\"1904671\" timestamp=\"1442251904\"]\n @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]\n\nThank you for this....I wonder why they are pushing the 5pm time for sunset then?  That&#039;s what had me in such a panic. I see a lot of issues with their way of planning, and I am such a planner it&#039;s getting hard to stay relaxed during all of this lol.[\/quote]\nIt might be because she is not sure of exactly your plans? I have no idea.\nI kind of came up with a schedule thru seeing brides posts on here, then I sent it to my WC and my photographer for suggestions.  Generally it was the photographer who helped me square it away. Is that an option for you, to ask your photographer?","Attachments":[],"Id":1904672,"PostDate":1442237632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RivieraBride15, on 14 September 2015 - 01:31 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for this....I wonder why they are pushing the 5pm time for sunset then?\u00a0 That's what had me in such a panic.\u00a0I see a lot of issues with their way of planning, and I am such a planner it's getting hard to stay relaxed during all of this lol.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It might be because she is not sure of exactly your plans? I have no idea.<\/p>\n<p>I kind of came up with a schedule thru seeing brides posts on here, then I sent it to my WC and my photographer for suggestions. \u00a0Generally it was the photographer who helped me square it away. Is that an option for you, to ask your photographer?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":37,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
