lse,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"190476999794a741568a0473f1ca7305","RawContent":"[quote name=\"brownskingirl\" post=\"1905710\" timestamp=\"1443649690\"]\nOriginal Mori Lee 3124 size 18 slightly altered, like new for sale $600 I&#039;m trying to figure out how to post pics on here!!!\nI&#039;m selling my slightly used original Mori Lee gown size 18 slightly altered, like new for $600[\/quote]if you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you&#039;re happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos.  good luck\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1905711,"PostDate":1443635502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>brownskingirl, on 30 September 2015 - 05:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Original Mori Lee 3124 size 18 slightly altered, like new for sale $600 I'm trying to figure out how to post pics on here!!!<br>\nI'm selling my slightly used original Mori Lee gown size 18 slightly altered, like new for $600<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nif you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you're happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos.  good luck<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.244.77.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e55151a5dfdf47bd6771a4921d26fe7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1905711\" timestamp=\"1443649902\"]\nif you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you&#039;re happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos. good luck\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk[\/quote]thank you :)\n\nbetter pics can be sent upon request.","Attachments":[],"Id":1905712,"PostDate":1443636736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 30 September 2015 - 05:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>if you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you're happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos. good luck<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>better pics can be sent upon request.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349734426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"30824","Title":"Post all \"Knock Off Wedding Dress\" questions\/comments here","LastPostDate":1443636736},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6406,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6400,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":6390,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
